    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just got another letter today. another rejection. it's the same thing every single month. i've submitted the forms, i've called the offices, i've done everything they told me to do but it's like i don't even exist to them. it's like i'm just a glitch in their system that they keep hitting 'delete' on. i'm so tired of fighting a machine that isn't even human. what's even the point of trying to exist in a world that won't even acknowledge you're here?",
