      "content": "it doesn't matter who I am though. an identity doesn't pay the rent or stop the eviction notices. they've basically made it impossible for me to live a normal life, even when I do everything right. it feels like the world has already decided i'm not worth the space i'm taking up. it's just a slow, endless sinkhole. how am i supposed to keep finding \"worth\" when the basic structures of life are just actively trying to erase me?",
